arily full payment processing).\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: When an order is placed/confirmed, an invoice record is automatically created and linked to the order without manual staff action.\",\n     \"1: Customer/staff can view and download the invoice as a PDF, correctly reflecting order items, prices, and totals.\",\n     \"2: Each invoice has a payment status field (e.g., unpaid, paid, overdue) that is updated as payment events occur.\",\n     \"3: If invoice PDF generation fails, the system retries or flags the invoice for manual regeneration rather than leaving it permanently missing.\",\n     \"4: Customers can only view/download invoices belonging to their own company; staff/admin can view all.\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"76-administration\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Admin-only screens for managing products, price lists, and users.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Only admin role can access product administration, price-list administration, and user administration screens.\",\n     \"1: Admin creates/edits/deletes a product record (name, description, images, category, vehicle compatibility, stock) and changes are reflected in the customer catalogue.\",\n     \"2: Admin creates/edits a price list and assigns it to one or more companies; pricing changes apply to those customers immediately.\",\n     \"3: Admin creates/edits/deactivates user accounts and assigns roles (customer, staff, admin).\",\n     \"4: Admin attempting to delete a product referenced by existing orders is blocked or the product is archived rather than hard-deleted.\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"76-reporting-csv-exports\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Admin/staff can view reports (e.g., sales, order volume) and export underlying data as CSV.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Staff/admin selects a report type and date range → system displays aggregated figures (e.g., orders, revenue) matching the applied filters.\",\n     \"1: Staff/admin exports the report data 