oice records must be retained and remain retrievable for at least seven years from creation, and not be deletable before then.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Order and invoice records remain stored and queryable for a minimum of 7 years from creation date.\",\n     \"1: Attempts (manual or automated) to permanently delete an order/invoice record before the 7-year retention period has elapsed are blocked.\",\n     \"2: After 7 years, retained records can be archived/purged per policy (if defined) without affecting records still within the retention window.\"\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nList the disagreements."}